:: Bus Thug Inspection Leave
<<effects>><<set $outside to 1>>
<<if Time.dayState is "night" and $rng gt 33>>
	You get up and walk to the doors, <span class="red">only to find them closed</span>. You press the "stop" button to indicate you want to get out, only to be ignored.
	The <<person1>><<person>> hands something to the bus driver and then walks over to you. "This your stop, <<girl>>?" <<he>> asks. You nod. 
	<br><br>
	<<He>> looks you over, then motions <<his>> friend over. "It's dangerous to be walking around alone this late. We'll escort you to where you're going," <<he>> says.
	<br><br>
	"Yeah, we wouldn't want anything bad to happen to you," the <<person2>><<person>> says. You doubt they have good intentions, or that they'll take 'no' for an answer.
	<br><br>
	While you're still thinking, the bus doors suddenly open. The duo push you out before you can react, almost causing you to fall, if not for the <<person>> grabbing you by the arm and keeping you upright.
	"I'm glad we found you now. You were just on your way home to go pay your dues, right? We'll gladly take you there right now," <<he>> says. There's no doubt about it now. <span class="blue">They must be Bailey's thugs.</span>
	<br><br>
	The <<person1>><<person>> chuckles. "Oh, and in case our pleasant demeanour made it seem like you have a choice in the matter, you don't."
	<br><br>
	<<link [[Resist|Bus Thug Inspection Fight]]>><<set $fightstart to 1>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[Comply|Bus Thug Inspection Comply]]>><<pass 5>><</link>>
	<br>
<<else>>
	You decide not to risk it and get off early, making sure to distance the bus stop too. They don't follow.
	<br><br>
	<<endevent>>
	<<destinationbusrandom>>
<</if>>

:: Bus Thug Inspection Hide
<<effects>><<saveNPC 0 "rent_thug">><<saveNPC 1 "rent_thug_2">><<endevent>><<generate1>><<person1>>
You quickly get up and move further back, seeking a discreet seat next to someone. You notice one such spot next to a <<person>> and take it.
<br><br>
"Well well, didn't expect a cute <<girl>> like you to come sit next to me," <<he>> says. "Be honest, you noticed how hot I am and just had to come over, right?"
<br>
You tell <<him>> you just moved here because you need to hide. "Oh, you wanna play around a little, I gotcha. Well, who are you hiding from then?"
<br>
You point out the suspicious duo as your would-be seekers. "Them huh? Alright, how about we switch seats, hide you even more." You accept and move to the window side.
<br><br>
Once there, <<he>> puts a hand on your thigh. "This also makes it more discreet for us to have some fun."
<br><br>
<<link [[Next|Bus Thug Inspection Hide Rape]]>><<set $molestationstart to 1>><</link>>
<br>

